# Piper PA-46T Meridian - MFD checklist set (G1000 NXi Checklist page group).
# Auto-selected when the loaded aircraft is a PA46T.

GROUP NORMAL PROCEDURES

  CHECKLIST BEFORE STARTING ENGINE
    Preflight Inspection : COMPLETE
    Passenger Briefing : COMPLETE
    Seats, Belts, Harnesses : ADJUST AND LOCK
    Brakes : TEST AND SET
    Circuit Breakers : CHECK IN
    Condition Lever : CUT-OFF
    Fuel Selector : ON / AUTO

  CHECKLIST ENGINE START
    Propeller : HIGH RPM
    Battery Master : ON
    Avionics Master : OFF
    Fuel Pumps : ON / AUTO
    Starter Switch : ENGAGE
    Condition Lever : RUN (ABOVE 13% NG)
    ITT : MONITOR (MAX 800 C)
    Generator Switch : ON
    Avionics Master : ON

  CHECKLIST BEFORE TAKEOFF
    Parking Brake : SET
    Flight Controls : FREE AND CORRECT
    Flight Instruments : CHECK AND SET
    Flaps : SET FOR TAKEOFF (10 DEG)
    Elevator Trim : SET FOR TAKEOFF
    Annunciator Panel : CHECK

  CHECKLIST CRUISE
    Power (Torque) : SET (MAX 1313 FT-LB)
    Engine Instruments : MONITOR
    Fuel Quantity / Balance : CHECK

  CHECKLIST BEFORE LANDING
    Seats, Belts : SECURE
    Landing Light : ON
    Autopilot : DISENGAGE
    Flaps : AS DESIRED (BELOW 168 KIAS)
    Gear : DOWN (BELOW 168 KIAS)

  CHECKLIST SHUTDOWN
    Parking Brake : SET
    Power Lever : IDLE
    Avionics Master : OFF
    Condition Lever : CUT-OFF
    Generator Switch : OFF
    Battery Master : OFF

GROUP EMERGENCY PROCEDURES

  CHECKLIST ENGINE FAILURE DURING TAKEOFF ROLL
    Power Lever : IDLE
    Brakes : APPLY
    Condition Lever : CUT-OFF
    Battery Master : OFF

  CHECKLIST ENGINE FAILURE IN FLIGHT
    Airspeed : 95 KIAS (Glide)
    Power Lever : IDLE
    Condition Lever : CUT-OFF
    Fuel Selector : ON / AUTO
    Battery Master : ON
    Starter Switch : ENGAGE (Re-light)
